r leave to proceed <em>in forma pauperis </em>granted. Certiorari granted, judgments vacated, and eases remanded for further consideration in light of <em>Carachuri-Rosendo </em>v. <em>Holder, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9435958\"><a href=\"/opinion/150542/carachuri-rosendo-v-holder/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Carachuri-Rosendo v. Holder\">560 U. S. 563</a></span> (2010).</p>\n<judges id=\"AyC\">Justice Kagan took no part in the consideration or decision of these motions and these petitions.</judges>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}